  "about": "One positive and one near miss for each AML scenario in app/services/aml.py, each built alone on a scratch database. Thresholds: structuring is 3 subscriptions from $8,500 up to (not including) $10,000 within 7 days; money in and straight out is a redemption of at least 75% of $10,000 or more paid in within the 10 days before; third-party funding is an accepted match whose payer's name shares under half its words with the holder's; a linked round trip is a redemption followed within 14 days by a subscription within 10% of it into another person's account paid from the same bank account; velocity is 5 instructions or orders within 24 hours; dormant reactivation is a subscription of $25,000 or more after 180 days without activity; the jurisdiction scenario is any instruction in the last 30 days by a person recorded in Iran, North Korea or Myanmar. Every instruction is placed at 15:00 UTC (11:00 in New York) unless an hour is given. Synthetic people only.",
